WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
Reactor Relay: twelve robots split between cargo crews and gate controls.
Teacher-guided coordination with movement trained through demonstrations and PPO.

00:09.000 --> 00:21.667
Two loads move through the industrial site while other robots hold gates open.

00:21.667 --> 00:25.167
A crew brings another load to its delivery point.

00:25.167 --> 00:29.167
Lattice Freightworks: gate holders support a cargo crew and a solo carrier.
An excerpt, not a completed mission.

00:29.167 --> 00:34.033
Back to Reactor Relay for the last delivery.

00:34.033 --> 00:41.267
All six loads delivered. All twelve robots extracted.
Fully learned mission coordination remains unfinished.
